# STEP 4 — RESOURCE COMPILATION

Implement Android resource compilation using AAPT2 or the most appropriate Android resource compiler available for the target architecture.

Required operations:

* compile resources
* link resources
* generate R class/resource IDs
* process AndroidManifest.xml
* package resources
* process assets

The build engine should locate its bundled resource compiler internally.

Do NOT require the user to manually install Android Studio.

If AAPT2 cannot legally or technically be bundled directly, design a downloadable build-tools package system.

